## 👩‍💻 About Me

I am an aspiring Data Analyst with a strong interest in using data to understand business performance, identify trends, uncover patterns, and communicate insights effectively.

I enjoy working with structured data and turning complex information into simple, actionable insights.

I am continuously developing my technical and analytical skills through hands-on projects and practical data analysis exercises.

